#: main.cpp:17
msgid ""
"KLettres helps a very young child or an adult learning \n"
"a new language by associating sounds and \n"
"letters in this language.\n"
"5 languages are available: Czech, Danish, Dutch, French and Slovak."
msgstr ""
"KLetes aide on djonne efant oudonbén ene grande\n"
"djin k' aprind on novea lingaedje a mete eshonne\n"
"les letes eyet les sons di ç' lingaedje la.\n"
"I gn a cénk lingaedjes: daenwès, francès, neyerlandès, slovake eyet "
"tcheke."

